Branch release/2.1.x, commit 14efb84e8 (2026-03-18).

Pinata Labs changed the original work. The main changes are:

- The build targets net10.0 and netstandard2.1 only. Code for the removed
  target frameworks is removed.
- The shared build infrastructure of Six Labors is copied into this
  repository.
- The dependencies are updated to current versions.
- The code is changed to remove all compiler and analyzer warnings.
- The package ID and the assembly name are PinataLabs.ImagePastel, and the
  assembly is signed with a Pinata Labs strong-name key.
- The build, test, and publish pipeline is replaced.

The Git history of https://github.com/PinataLabs/ImagePastel records each
change.

